From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:31:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] group bar: the tabs slide out with their window

A window leaving with its workspace hid its group bar at the first frame of
the slide while the window itself slid out; the bar now stays until the
window is gone, so the tabs move with it both ways.
---
 src/manage/client.c | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/manage/client.c b/src/manage/client.c
index 104c9f51..f3040cdc 100644
--- a/src/manage/client.c
+++ b/src/manage/client.c
@@ -4460,9 +4460,13 @@ void client_check_tab_node_visible(Client *c) {
 
 	Client *cur = client_group_head(c);
 	while (cur) {
+		/* A window sliding out with its workspace keeps its tabs until it
+		 * is gone: they slide out with it, as Hyprland's group bar. */
+		bool on_view = TAGMATCH(c, c->mon) ||
+					   (c->animation.running && c->animation.tagouting);
 		bool show = !c->mon->isoverview && cur->group_bar &&
-					client_wants_group_bar(cur) && TAGMATCH(c, c->mon) &&
-					ISNORMAL(c) && !c->isfullscreen;
+					client_wants_group_bar(cur) && on_view && ISNORMAL(c) &&
+					!c->isfullscreen;
 		if (!cur->group_bar) {
 			cur = cur->group_next;
 			continue;
